## Recommendation
Verdict: passed. One decree family, safe-helpers: record dates go through one strict parser and officina files through the contained helpers, and a census in the build lists every raw date parse and raw file access with a disposition, so a new one fails until it is decided. Six behaviours over two test files plus the mutants harness.
Seven defaults ship as stated and are veto-able at the checkpoint; the follow-ons are named in Out of scope.
